<p>I hadn’t really considered that- originally I was just going to give the generic answer that they stole it, but that’s not very creative. I will probably drop the paratech in the final article.</p>
<p>And, yes! The ads wouldn’t strictly target people, but they would be ‘personalised’, in a sense. The images and text would change based on previous searches the user had made, and videos they’d clicked on. So, not to an anomalous degree- more like the kind of tracking that Amazon does to you. <sub>Which, y’know, still creepily accurate, but i’m pretty sure Jeff Bezos doesn’t have access to anomalous cookies.</sub></p>
<p>Thanks for the crit! I really do appreciate it.</p>

